 "lead": "Bu sayfa Yahudi dostlarımıza saygıyla yazıldı. İsa da, annesi Meryem de, havarilerin hepsi de Yahudiydi. Burada Nasıralı İsa’nın, İsrail’in beklediği Mesih olduğuna neden inandığımızı Tanah’ın kendi sözleriyle anlatıyoruz. Kimseyi küçümsemeden, kendi tarihimizin ayıplarını saklamadan.",
 "leadEn": "This page was written with respect for our Jewish friends. Jesus was a Jew, and so were his mother Mary and every one of the apostles. Here we explain, in the words of the Tanakh itself, why we believe that Jesus of Nazareth is the Messiah Israel was waiting for. We do it without looking down on anyone, and without hiding the shameful pages of our own history.",
 "note": "Bu sayfa, Katolik Kilisesi’nin Yahudilikle ilişkiler üzerine belgelerine göre yazıldı: II. Vatikan Konsili’nin <a class=\"sref\" href=\"https://www.vatican.va/archive/hist_councils/ii_vatican_council/documents/vat-ii_decl_19651028_nostra-aetate_en.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nostra Aetate bildirisi</a> (1965), Yahudilikle Dini İlişkiler Komisyonu’nun <a class=\"sref\" href=\"https://www.christianunity.va/content/unitacristiani/en/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo-crre/documenti-della-commissione/en3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">yönergeleri (1974, 1985)</a>, <a class=\"sref\" href=\"https://www.christianunity.va/content/unitacristiani/en/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo-crre/documenti-della-commissione/en1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">“Hatırlıyoruz” (1998)</a> ve <a class=\"sref\" href=\"https://www.christianunity.va/content/unitacristiani/en/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo-crre/documenti-della-commissione/en.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">“Tanrı’nın Armağanları ve Çağrısı Geri Alınmaz”</a> (2015). Tanah yorumlarında Yahudi Mesih inancıyla ilgili münazaralardan, özellikle Michael L. Brown ve Brant Pitre’nin çalışmalarından yararlandık. Kutsal Kitap ve Katekizm göndermelerine tıklayarak metinleri kendiniz okuyabilirsiniz. Tanah, Yahudilerin kutsal kitabıdır; Hristiyanlar aynı kitaba Eski Ahit der.",
 "noteEn": "This page follows the Catholic Church’s own documents on relations with Judaism: the Second Vatican Council’s <a class=\"sref\" href=\"https://www.vatican.va/archive/hist_councils/ii_vatican_council/documents/vat-ii_decl_19651028_nostra-aetate_en.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">declaration Nostra Aetate</a> (1965), the guidelines of the Commission for Religious Relations with the Jews <a class=\"sref\" href=\"https://www.christianunity.va/content/unitacristiani/en/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo-crre/documenti-della-commissione/en3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">(1974, 1985)</a>, <a class=\"sref\" href=\"https://www.christianunity.va/content/unitacristiani/en/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo-crre/documenti-della-commissione/en1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">“We Remember” (1998)</a> and <a class=\"sref\" href=\"https://www.christianunity.va/content/unitacristiani/en/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo/commissione-per-i-rapporti-religiosi-con-l-ebraismo-crre/documenti-della-commissione/en.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">“The Gifts and the Calling of God Are Irrevocable”</a> (2015). For the reading of the Tanakh we drew on debates about the Jewish hope of the Messiah, above all the work of Michael L. Brown and Brant Pitre. Click any Bible or Catechism reference to read the text for yourself. The Tanakh is the Jewish Bible; Christians call the same books the Old Testament.",
